                   tone: enthusiastic
                   text: "The mathematics is beautiful, really. A universal factoring algorithm — I never thought about application. The university lab is very small, very modest. We have one good machine, one safe. Very basic security. The problem was interesting. What people do with the solution, that's — that's not my department."
